package: httpx
from: 0.26.0
to: 0.28.1

## changelog

## 0.28.1 — 2024-12-06
Fix SSL when verify=False.

## 0.28.0 — 2024-11-29
Drop deprecated APIs.

## 0.27.0 — 2024-04-15
New Auth flow.

## dependency changes
+ added: anyio
- removed: httpcore-py3
~ bumped: httpcore (==0.17.* → ==1.*)

## api changes
+ added: httpx.AsyncClient.aclose
+ added: httpx.URL.copy_with
- removed: httpx.Client.send_singlerequest
~ changed: httpx.Client.send  (was: def send(request); now: def send(request, *, stream=False))
